      "id": "claim_1e9d367ebe96424e9f3ddfc8200359f1",
      "statement": "_load_settings parses settings.json when present, reconstructs each section with its dataclass (converting a list-typed color_xy to a tuple and resetting a non-list light_ids to []), falls back to defaults plus logging on a JSON decode/type error, and runs validation and config-dir creation either way before the manager is usable.",
