    {
      "id": "claim_ca57e58b3752421180161016cc922395",
      "statement": "Autostart is managed by writing/removing io.github.enginkirmaci.lumux.desktop in the session autostart directory ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart under Flatpak, ~/.config/autostart otherwise): native builds exec the current Python interpreter plus the absolute script path, Flatpak builds exec `flatpak run io.github.enginkirmaci.lumux`, and a post-write existence check raises PermissionError advising filesystem=host when a sandboxed Flatpak cannot reach the host directory.",
