    {
      "id": "claim_5ac3a10ff837497fb89ba6a17775fc1a",
      "statement": "generate_ambilight_mapping bins each positioned light by thresholds (z > 0.4 top, z < -0.3 bottom, x < -0.4 left, x > 0.4 right, otherwise top); a gradient-capable strip (name/archetype containing 'strip' with z > -0.2) is additionally added to the left, top, and right bins; non-gradient lights map to a zone index by normalizing the along-edge coordinate (x for top/bottom, z for left/right) into [0, count-1] with clamping while gradient lights join every zone on their edge; without any hardware info lights fall back to round-robin over the four edges.",
